+/* Trigger-anchored surfaces scale in and out from their trigger, not their
+ * centre. Every Radix popover, menu, submenu, select, tooltip, and hover card
+ * renders its content as the direct child of the popper wrapper, which
+ * publishes the trigger-facing point as --radix-popper-transform-origin. The
+ * per-component --radix-*-content-transform-origin names alias it. bb 0.49
+ * sets no origin on most of them, and its hover-card and menubar origin
+ * utilities compile to invalid CSS. Dialogs and sheets have no popper wrapper,
+ * so they keep their centre. Only the origin changes; bb owns the motion. */
+.dark [data-radix-popper-content-wrapper] > [data-side] {
+  transform-origin: var(--radix-popper-transform-origin);
+}
